From 6939377466d0cd795be353096a14a80eb3461abc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:36:50 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(app): fold the 18 turning_* suites into the turning
 directory suite

Wave 1 of #3190. The flat crates/app/tests/turning_*.rs binaries move to
crates/app/tests/turning/ and turning.rs loads each one with #[path].
Each module keeps its old binary name, so turning_bore::x names the
same test as before. Each submodule keeps its Gate map header.

- mod common; becomes use crate::common; (removed in four files that
  did not use it).
- Two include_str! paths get one more ../ for the deeper directory.

Before: 19 binaries, 115 tests, 0 ignored. After: 1 binary, the same
115 qualified test names, 0 ignored. The 18 old debug binaries took
2,306 MB on Linux; the folded binary takes 201 MB.

Refs #3190

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
